# The studio's private source archive (the Kingston drive: WTFIA, GrowingAloha,
# 2008-2009 photography and reference plates). Described publicly in the
# evidence records at data/linked-art/evidence-*.json, but deliberately not
# published: it carries third-party press images gathered in 2009 and unrelated
# project material, and the records state that the fuller archive remains held
# by the studio pending redaction and rights review. Individual items are
# published one at a time, after review — see images/adams-verso-2008.jpg.
/reference-folders/

# Local denylist of third-party names withheld from the public records.
# Never commit this: a denylist in a public repo publishes what it protects.
.pii-denylist
